# Catalog updates

Before editing this repo, follow `AGENTS.md`.

This repo is a map, not the project code. Update `README.md` and `README.zh.md` together. Put third-party ROCm pull requests only in English `upstream/README.md`. Put older reproduction steps in `history/`, with a validation window and a not-retested month. Leave out unverified forks and anything that was never run.
